hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"190","[AI-translation] Haddasana Mahmud bin Ghaylan, qala: haddasana Abu Ahmad al-Zubayri, qala: haddasana Sufyan al-Thawri, 'an Abi Hashim, 'an Isma'il bin Riyah, 'an abihi Riyah bin 'Ubaydah, 'an Abi Sa'id al-Khudri, qala: Rasulullah (sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam) jab khana kha kar faragh farmatey to farmatey: Al-hamdu lillah alladhi at'amana wa saqana wa ja'alana muslimin."
"191","[AI-translation] Haddasana Muhammad bin Bashshar, qala: haddasana Yahya bin Sa'id, qala: haddasana Thawr bin Yazid, 'an Khalid bin Ma'dan, 'an Abi Umamah, qala: Rasulullah (sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam) jab unke aage se dastarkhan uthaya jata to yeh farmatey: Al-hamdu lillah hamdan kathiran tayyiban mubarakan fih, ghayra muda' wa la mustaghna 'anhu Rabbana."
